  "info": {
    "name": "Restaurant API (Green Fork)",
    "description": "Assignment 2 \u2013 Muhammad Wasim (9513).\n1. Run the server: `npm run seed` then `npm run dev`.\n2. Run the 'Auth' folder first \u2013 the login requests save customerToken and managerToken automatically.\n3. Then run the other folders from top to bottom.\nChange `baseUrl` in the collection Variables if needed.",
